    "text": "The hybridization of $\\mathrm{XeO}_3 \\mathrm{F}_2$ is $s p^3 d$ and its structure is trigonal bipyramidal in which oxygen atoms are situated on the plane and the fluoride atoms are on the top and bottom.\n<img src=\"assets\\st0162_00f67f2f2177.png\"><br>"
